---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Giving
description: Support the ministry of Saint Elizabeth Orthodox Church through online tithes, offerings, and gifts.
permalink: /giving/
banner: /assets/img/photos/cross-meadow.jpg
pageScripts:
  - https://js.stripe.com/v3/
  - /assets/js/giving.js
---

<article class="page">
  {% set hdrEyebrow = "Stewardship" %}
  {% set hdrTitle = "Giving" %}
  {% set hdrLede %}"As a sacrifice to God, thou didst arm thyself with works of mercy, patience, and love." Our patron gave away the wealth of a princess. Our own offerings, however modest, share in that same sacrifice.{% endset %}
  {% include "partials/page-header.njk" %}

  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p>
      Giving sustains the daily life of our parish: our clergy, our worship, our building, and our care
      for neighbors on the Kitsap Peninsula. Gifts may be made online, in the offering plate on Sunday,
      or by mail.
    </p>

    {% if giving.configured %}

      <div class="grid wide" style="margin: 2.5rem 0;">
        {% for fund in giving.funds %}
          <div class="card">
            <h3>{{ fund.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ fund.description }}</p>
            {% if fund.suggestedAmounts %}
              <ul class="amounts">
                {% for amount in fund.suggestedAmounts %}
                  <li>${{ amount }}</li>
                {% endfor %}
                <li>Other</li>
              </ul>
            {% endif %}
            {% if fund.url %}
              <p>
                <a class="button" href="{{ fund.url }}" rel="noopener">
                  {% if fund.recurring %}Give monthly{% else %}Give now{% endif %}
                </a>
              </p>
            {% else %}
              <p><span class="button" aria-disabled="true">Coming soon</span></p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

    {% elif giving.demo.enabled %}

      <div class="notice notice-demo">
        <strong>Preview only — no payment is taken.</strong>
        This is a working mock of the online giving experience, built so the parish council can review
        the flow and compare providers before choosing one. Switch providers below to see how the
        donor experience and the fees change. Nothing is submitted to any payment system and no card
        is charged. Please use the offering plate or mail a check in the meantime.
      </div>

      {% set demoConfig = { demo: true, publishableKey: giving.demo.publishableKey, defaultProvider: giving.demo.defaultProvider, zelle: giving.zelle, providers: giving.providers, funds: giving.funds } %}
      <script type="application/json" id="giving-config">
        {{ demoConfig | dump | safe }}
      </script>

      <section class="provider-picker" aria-labelledby="provider-picker-title">
        <h2 id="provider-picker-title" class="provider-picker-title">Compare payment providers</h2>
        <p class="provider-picker-lede">
          A cursory review of the realistic options. Figures come from vendor documentation rather
          than live accounts — see <code>docs/giving-setup.md</code> before deciding.
        </p>

        <div class="provider-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Payment provider">
          {% for provider in giving.providers %}
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              id="tab-{{ provider.id }}"
              class="provider-tab"
              data-provider-tab="{{ provider.id }}"
              aria-controls="panel-{{ provider.id }}"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            >
              <span class="provider-tab-name">{{ provider.name }}</span>
              <span class="provider-tab-fee">{{ provider.fee.label }}</span>
            </button>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

        {% for provider in giving.providers %}
          <div
            class="provider-panel"
            id="panel-{{ provider.id }}"
            role="tabpanel"
            aria-labelledby="tab-{{ provider.id }}"
            data-provider-panel="{{ provider.id }}"
            tabindex="0"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="provider-tagline">{{ provider.tagline }}</p>

            <dl class="provider-specs">
              {% for spec in provider.specs %}
                <div class="provider-spec is-{{ spec.status }}">
                  <dt>{{ spec.label }}</dt>
                  <dd>{{ spec.value }}</dd>
                </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </dl>

            {% if provider.caveats %}
              <ul class="provider-caveats">
                {% for caveat in provider.caveats %}
                  <li>{{ caveat }}</li>
                {% endfor %}
              </ul>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </section>

      <h2 class="giving-form-title">
        Donor experience with <span id="provider-name-inline">Stripe</span>
      </h2>

      <form class="giving-form" id="giving-form" novalidate hidden>
        <fieldset class="field-group">
          <legend>Choose a fund</legend>
          <div class="fund-options">
            {% for fund in giving.funds %}
              <label class="fund-option">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="fund"
                  value="{{ fund.id }}"
                  {% if loop.first %}checked{% endif %}
                />
                <span class="fund-option-body">
                  <span class="fund-option-title">{{ fund.title }}</span>
                  <span class="fund-option-text">{{ fund.description }}</span>
                </span>
              </label>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="field-group" id="frequency-fields">
          <legend>How often</legend>
          <div class="segmented">
            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="frequency" id="frequency-once" value="once" checked />
              <span>One-time</span>
            </label>
            <label id="frequency-monthly-field">
              <input type="radio" name="frequency" id="frequency-monthly" value="monthly" />
              <span id="frequency-monthly-label">Monthly</span>
            </label>
          </div>
          <span class="field-note" id="monthly-note" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="field-group">
          <legend>Amount</legend>
          <div class="amount-options" id="amount-options"></div>
          <label class="field" for="custom-amount">
            <span class="field-label">Other amount</span>
            <span class="amount-input">
              <span aria-hidden="true">$</span>
              <input
                type="number"
                id="custom-amount"
                name="custom-amount"
                inputmode="decimal"
                min="1"
                step="0.01"
                placeholder="0.00"
              />
            </span>
          </label>
          <label class="checkbox" id="cover-fees-field">
            <input type="checkbox" id="cover-fees" name="cover-fees" />
            <span id="cover-fees-label">
              Cover the processing cost so the parish receives my full gift<span
                id="cover-fees-amount"
              ></span>
            </span>
          </label>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="field-group">
          <legend>Your details</legend>
          <label class="field" for="donor-name">
            <span class="field-label">Name <span class="field-optional">(optional)</span></span>
            <input type="text" id="donor-name" name="donor-name" autocomplete="name" />
          </label>
          <label class="field" for="donor-email">
            <span class="field-label">Email for your receipt</span>
            <input
              type="email"
              id="donor-email"
              name="donor-email"
              autocomplete="email"
              required
            />
          </label>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="field-group">
          <legend id="payment-legend">Card</legend>

          <div data-payment="stripe" hidden>
            <div id="payment-element" class="payment-element"></div>
            <p class="field-error" id="card-errors" role="alert" hidden></p>
            <p class="field-note">
              This is Stripe's real Payment Element, rendered straight from Stripe. Notice the
              <strong>US bank account</strong> tab: ACH costs 0.8% capped at $5.00, so on a large
              regular tithe it is dramatically cheaper than a card. Details are entered inside
              Stripe's own frame and never reach this website. In this preview they are validated
              but never charged — test with <code>4242 4242 4242 4242</code>, any future expiry, and
              any CVC.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div data-payment="square" hidden>
            <div id="square-card" class="payment-element" hidden></div>
            <div class="card-element is-placeholder" id="square-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="placeholder-brand"></span>
              <span class="placeholder-text">Card number</span>
              <span class="placeholder-meta">MM / YY</span>
              <span class="placeholder-meta">CVC</span>
            </div>
            <p class="field-error" id="square-errors" role="alert" hidden></p>
            <p class="field-note" id="square-note">
              Square's Web Payments SDK is wired up here, but it needs an application ID and
              location ID tied to a real Square account, so it stays dormant until those are filled
              into <code>src/_data/giving.json</code>. Square's advantage is above this field rather
              than in it: a donation link takes a donor-chosen amount on a one-time
              <em>or recurring</em> schedule.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div data-payment="iframe" hidden>
            <div id="donorbox-embed" hidden></div>
            <div class="embed-placeholder" id="donorbox-placeholder">
              <p><strong>Donorbox donation form</strong></p>
              <p>
                Donorbox is embedded as an <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>, so the donor never leaves
                this page. The form itself — amount, frequency, card entry, receipts — is served and
                operated by Donorbox, which holds the Stripe credentials on its own servers. That is
                why it can offer a donor-chosen monthly amount when Stripe alone cannot.
              </p>
              <p class="field-note">
                Not embedded live here on purpose: a real Donorbox iframe would take real money for
                whichever campaign it points at. Set <code>donorbox.campaign</code> in
                <code>src/_data/giving.json</code> to switch it on.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div data-payment="zelle" hidden>
            <div class="zelle-instructions">
              <p>
                Zelle has no form to embed. The donor opens their own banking app and sends the gift
                directly to the parish, which is why it costs nothing to either side.
              </p>
              <dl class="receipt-list copyable">
                <dt>Send to</dt>
                <dd>
                  <span id="zelle-handle">Not yet configured</span>
                  <button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy="zelle-handle">Copy</button>
                </dd>
                <dt>Amount</dt>
                <dd>
                  <span id="zelle-amount">Choose an amount above</span>
                  <button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy="zelle-amount">Copy</button>
                </dd>
                <dt>Memo</dt>
                <dd>
                  <span id="zelle-memo">—</span>
                  <button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy="zelle-memo">Copy</button>
                </dd>
              </dl>
              <p class="field-note" id="zelle-frequency-note"></p>
              <p class="field-note">
                Nothing here is automatic: no receipt is issued, and the treasurer matches the memo
                line against the bank statement by hand.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <p class="giving-summary" id="giving-summary" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <p class="field-error" id="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <button type="submit" class="button" id="giving-submit">
          <span id="giving-submit-label">Give</span>
        </button>
        <p class="field-note" id="no-submit-note" hidden>
          There is no button to press — the gift is sent from the donor's banking app.
        </p>
      </form>

      <div class="giving-receipt" id="giving-receipt" role="status" hidden>
        <h2>Thank you — this was a preview</h2>
        <p>
          In a live setting you would now receive an emailed receipt and the gift would appear in the
          parish's Stripe dashboard. <strong>No payment was taken and no card was submitted.</strong>
        </p>
        <div id="giving-receipt-body"></div>
        <p>
          <button type="button" class="button ghost" id="giving-restart">Try again</button>
        </p>
      </div>

      <noscript>
        <div class="notice">
          The online giving preview needs JavaScript. Gifts may still be made in person or by mail —
          see below.
        </div>
      </noscript>

    {% else %}

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Online giving is not yet live.</strong>
        The parish administrator needs to create Stripe Payment Links and add them to
        <code>src/_data/giving.json</code>. See <code>docs/giving-setup.md</code> for step-by-step
        instructions.
      </div>

    {% endif %}

    <h2>Other ways to give</h2>

    <h3>In person</h3>
    <p>
      Offerings may be placed in the plate at any service, or given directly to the rector or parish
      treasurer.
    </p>

    {% if giving.mail.enabled %}
      <h3>By mail</h3>
      <p>
        Checks may be made payable to <strong>{{ giving.mail.payee }}</strong> and mailed to:
      </p>
      <p>
        {{ site.address.street }}<br />
        {{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.region }} {{ site.address.postalCode }}
      </p>
    {% endif %}

    <h3>Questions</h3>
    <p>
      For questions about stewardship, pledging, planned giving, or year-end contribution statements,
      please contact Father John at <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="notice">
      Saint Elizabeth Orthodox Church is a parish of the
      <a href="{{ site.jurisdiction.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ site.jurisdiction.name }}</a>. Please
      confirm the parish's current tax-exempt status and EIN with the treasurer before publishing a
      deductibility statement here.
    </p>
  </div>
</article>
